From: spencer <the.spencer.harmon@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Add tests for ChannelManager per-item refresh

Covers dispatch logic for IChannelItemRefreshManager.RefreshChannelItemAsync:

  - Argument validation (null + empty external id reject).
  - Nonexistent channel throws InvalidOperationException.
  - Targeted IChannelItemRefresh lookup is preferred over paging.
  - Paging fallback when channel does not implement IChannelItemRefresh.
  - Item-removed-from-channel logs and returns without invalidating cache.
  - Cache invalidation fires when info found AND flag set.
  - All-flags-false performs lookup only.

The full BaseItem persistence path (item.UpdateToRepositoryAsync,
SaveMediaSources, QueueRefresh with EnableRemoteContentProbe=true)
depends on statically-wired BaseItem services and is exercised by
plugin-side integration scenarios rather than this unit harness.
